; Self test of the fixed form of the TED bug-orig tests
; (tests/bug-orig/CMakeLists.txt): "; @fixed #N" without a pair, judged by
; the script's expectation alone.  The expectation holds of TED-C (blitz2
; without a file, QUIT, the command's output ends with rc=0), so tedab must
; report FIXED (exit status 0).  99999 is no issue.
; @fixed #99999
; @source none
; @expect stdout "rc=0"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
